sequenceDiagram
    participant U as You
    participant G as LangGraph (stream)
    participant M as Model node
    participant T as Tool node
    U->>G: stream({"messages": [...]}, stream_mode="updates")
    G->>M: model step — printed
    M-->>G: tool call
    G->>T: tool step — printed
    T-->>G: tool result
    G->>M: model step — printed
    M-->>G: final answer
    G-->>U: result
